{"id":"n2-144","title":"～は抜きにして","romaji":"〜wa nuki ni shite","jlptLevel":2,"shortExplanation":"Leaving aside, excluding.","longExplanation":"The ～は抜きにして grammar point is used to express the idea of 'leaving aside' or 'excluding' a certain aspect. It is often used to focus the discussion or judgment on something else by disregarding the omitted point.","formation":"Noun + は抜きにして","examples":[{"jp":"値段は抜きにして、味は美味しい。","romaji":"Nedan wa nuki ni shite, aji wa oishii.","en":"Leaving aside the price, the taste is delicious.","words":[{"surface":"値段","vocabId":"1600160","reading":"ねだん"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"抜き","vocabId":"2009330","reading":"ぬき"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"味","vocabId":"1526960","reading":"あじ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"美味しい","vocabId":"1486650","reading":"おいしい"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[1,2,3,4,5]},{"jp":"彼の性格は抜きにして、彼の実力は認めざるを得ない。","romaji":"Kare no seikaku wa nuki ni shite, kare no jitsuryoku wa mitomezaru o enai.","en":"Putting aside his personality, I have to acknowledge his ability.","words":[{"surface":"彼の","vocabId":"1000420","reading":"かれの"},{"surface":"性格","vocabId":"1375290","reading":"せいかく"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"抜き","vocabId":"2009330","reading":"ぬき"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"彼の","vocabId":"1000420","reading":"かれの"},{"surface":"実力","vocabId":"1321530","reading":"じつりょく"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"認め","vocabId":"1611790","reading":"みとめ"},{"surface":"ざるを得ない","vocabId":"2060970","reading":"ざるをえない"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[2,3,4,5,6]},{"jp":"デザインは抜きにして、この携帯電話の機能は優れています。","romaji":"Dezain wa nuki ni shite, kono keitai denwa no kinou wa sugurete imasu.","en":"Leaving aside the design, this phone’s features are excellent.","words":[{"surface":"デザイン","vocabId":null},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"抜き","vocabId":"2009330","reading":"ぬき"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"この","vocabId":null},{"surface":"携帯電話","vocabId":"1250690","reading":"けいたいでんわ"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"機能","vocabId":"1221130","reading":"きのう"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"優れています","vocabId":"1539080","reading":"すぐれています","baseForm":"優れる"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[1,2,3,4,5]},{"jp":"運転の速さは抜きにして、彼女は親切で信頼できる運転手だ。","romaji":"Unten no hayasa wa nuki ni shite, kanojo wa shinsetsu de shinrai dekiru untenshu da.","en":"Leaving aside her driving speed, she's a kind and trustworthy driver.","words":[{"surface":"運転","vocabId":"1172830","reading":"うんてん"},{"surface":"の","vocabId":null},{"surface":"速さ","vocabId":"1404990","reading":"はやさ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"抜き","vocabId":"2009330","reading":"ぬき"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"し","vocabId":"1310720","reading":"し","baseForm":"する"},{"surface":"て","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"彼女","vocabId":"1483150","reading":"かのじょ"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"親切","vocabId":"1365250","reading":"しんせつ"},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"だ"},{"surface":"信頼","vocabId":"1359730","reading":"しんらい"},{"surface":"できる","vocabId":"1340450","reading":"できる"},{"surface":"運転手","vocabId":"1172870","reading":"うんてんしゅ"},{"surface":"だ","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[3,4,5,6,7]}],"kind":"construction"}